OL,3,ATrump wants to reduce the cost of fuel
OL,4,Aas the midterms loom - will it work?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith just a few weeks to go before
OL,7,FAmericans head to the polls, Trump on
OL,8,FFriday announced a deal with President
OL,9,FVladimir Putin for Russian diesel to be
OL,10,Freleased immediately to the US and
OL,11,Fglobal markets.
OL,13,FHe said this included the immediate
OL,14,Fsupply of over 300,000 tonnes, 500,000
OL,15,Ftonnes in November and a further
OL,16,Fmillion tonnes "immediately
OL,17,Fthereafter".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
